EMEA – Net revenue for the EMEA region increased by $36.9 million or 113.2% for the year ended December 31, 2025, as compared to the same period in 2024. The increase is driven primarily by an increase of $33.1 million and $3.2 million in net revenue from our MLPE and GO ESS product lines, respectively. This growth was primarily driven by higher demand of our MLPE products in Germany, the Czech Republic, the United Kingdom, Italy and Poland, in addition to the sale of $3.1 million of our GO ESS products to a customer in Italy.
